title: Midnight, 14 August 1947
tags: intro, phase1
go-to: founding-hub

= A New State

Pakistan exists now. Two wings, separated by a thousand miles of India;
a Constituent Assembly that has not written a constitution; a
Governor-General whose exact powers no one has finished arguing about;
and, on both sides of the new border, columns of people walking in
opposite directions.

*The Muslim League has authority nobody else in the state can currently
check. What you do with that authority in the next twelve months will
outlast you.*

